====================================================================================================
  [ok] k = 3..16: FVS(>= (k-1)/k) = 2, FVS(>= (k-2)/k) = 2 + floor(k/2), FVS(>= 2/k) = Z(k) - 2, FVS(>= 1/k) = Z(k) - 1, each equal to the number of necklaces of density >= the threshold (explicit sets: all-ones + one rotation; ballot rotations ending in 0; negative-axis crossing set; Mykkeltveit)
  (section time 4.1s)

